# Hosts that answer automated requests with a rejection regardless of the link
# being valid. Excluding them keeps the link check honest: it fails only on
# links this repository can actually fix.

# npmjs.com is fronted by a bot filter that returns 403 to every non-browser
# client (verified locally and from CI runners), so the package badges and
# links in README.md and js/README.md are permanently "broken" to lychee even
# though they resolve fine in a browser.
https://www\.npmjs\.com/.*
